<title>FINLAND: RAUTAKIRJA 4-MTH PROFIT RISES 10 PCT.</title>
<headline>RAUTAKIRJA 4-MTH PROFIT RISES 10 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    59.7 vs 54.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   6.60 vs 5.97</p>
<p> Net sales					1,084.1 vs 1,066.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  54.5 vs 47.9</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	79.2 vs 71.0</p>
<p> Depreciation					24.7 vs 23.0</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 5.2 vs 6.2 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 7.1 gain</p>
<p> Profit before taxes			     59.7 vs 61.3</p>
<p> Net profit					  42.8 vs 43.8</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    54.1 vs 47.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish retailing group Rautakirja Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
